{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>to</b> Moses and to Aaron in the land of Egypt, saying. And juxtaposed to it is \"the month\" — to teach that the head of the father's house declares מקודש. Another interpretation: אל משה ואל אהרן החודש — to teach that testimony for the month is valid through relatives such as Moses and Aaron:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:29.876036813Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}